host without-codex
# On a Host without Codex, Claude works alone: the picker offers Claude's models
# and no Codex account, a conversation answers, and once the app starts again
# the conversation reopens and continues.
# iOS: testSimulatorUsesClaudeWithoutCodexAndRestoresConversation
expect "何に取り組みますか？" 30000
press モデル
expect "Claude Code" 20000
# The missing Codex is an error in the UI's language over its own words.
expect "エラーが発生しました。\ncodex: failed to resolve Codex executable" 10000
press "Claude Code"
press "Default (recommended)" after モデルを検索
press アカウントと週間残量
press アカウントを追加
type 認証コード "fixture-code#fixture-only" 15000
press サインインを完了
expect "claude@example.invalidを選択中" 20000
expect_absent "desktop@example.invalid"
press 閉じる
press "Default (recommended)"
screenshot claude-models
key escape
type "AI に依頼する" "Claude standalone"
press 送信
expect "reply 1: Claude standalone" 30000
expect_absent "Claude standalone" after "AI に依頼する"
relaunch
press "Claude standalone" 30000
expect "reply 1: Claude standalone" 20000
type "AI に依頼する" "Follow up"
press 送信
expect "reply 2: Follow up" 30000
screenshot continued
